            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">Play during Deployment.
For the rest of the game, in the Starting Phase before the Tactical Test, if a Friendly model will Deploy using the Flank Trait that turn choose a Friendly model to gain Tactician (1).</characteristic>
