It counts as a model (at 0 Rice Cost) when determining Zone Control.
When a model performs a Wait Action to Destroy this Terrain, it need not spend 2 Ki Tokens.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
