              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">While this model is in play, friendly Kyudoka models may use Flame Arrows Ki Feat as if it was written on their card.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Virtue+" id="d6c7-448b-305f-efa6" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">While this model is in play, when a friendly Loyal &amp; Ashigaru Model spends a Virtue token, in addition to any other benefit chosen, that model may remove a Reload Marker.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Wait" id="b297-df51-6685-4e87" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">When this model declares a Wait Action to remove Reload Markers, its Ranged Weapons gain Lightweight until the End Phase.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
