                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">While this model is in play, when a friendly Loyal &amp; Ashigaru Model spends a Virtue token, in addition to any other benefit chosen, if that model performs a Scenario Action, remove one fewer Activation Counters at the end of the action. They must have the required number of Activation Counters to declare the Action.</characteristic>
