              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">At the end of any activation when another Friendly model spends one or more Virtue Tokens, this model may Walk 1&quot;.
While this model is in play, when a Friendly Loyal model spends a Virtue Token you may choose one of the following effects for that model:
- Walk this model 1&quot;.
- Move this model out of BtB with an Enemy model until it leaves that model&apos;s ZoC.
- This model gains Dodge (1) and Ranged Defence (1) until the End Phase.
- This model gains Endurance until the End Phase.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
