      <profiles>
        <profile name="New Eagle Army" id="e6ab-5a49-bb4a-5c02" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">- During deployment add up to two permitted Shiho Clan or Ronin,  Enhancements or Terrain cards that were not Recruited into the Warband to the Warband for free. You may not exceed the max value for these cards.
- While a Friendly Ashigaru model has a Virtue Token they gain Prowess [Defence, Ranged]:(1) and do not suffer Melee Dice Penalties due to States.
- Friendly Loyal &amp; Samurai models gain Reach on Katana Melee Weapons.
- Ashigaru cost -1RC to recruit into this Warband.

Permitted [Ashigaru, Loyal, Ronin]
Exclusion [Models with Booted trait]</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
