          <profiles>
            <profile name="Lord of the Jwar Isles" id="7ed9-227b-972d-36aa" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">When an Enemy model that is not a Samurai or Ashigaru declares an action which will either...
- bring it into BtB with the Attached model or
- Targets the Attached model with a Ranged Attack or Ki Feat
...it must make a Challenge (5) Ki Test.
If the Enemy model is successful resolve the Action as normal.
lf unsuccessful its activation ends before any movement and it removes an Activation Counter, then discard this card.
This is a Trap effect.

Requirement [Loyal &amp; Samurai]</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
