              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">The Attached model loses Flank and Booted and may not gain these traits. 
This model always Deploys before other models, regardless of normal player order.
Deploy this model, then continue with Deploying Warbands following player order.

Before the first turn, you may remove one Pool Terrain element within 3&quot; of a neutral table edge.

