                <profile name="Michiharu&apos;s Jitte" id="a828-72f8-d709-0b3a" hidden="false" typeId="d2bb-86b4-edf3-c4e5" typeName="Special Card">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">When the Attached model causes Wounds in a Melee Exchange, after the exchange is complete you may choose one of the following:
- Attached model Heals 1 Wound.
- Enemy model suffers 1 Wound.
- Attached model gains +1 Melee Pool until the End Phase.

In the End Phase, the Attached model may spend 2 Ki Tokens; if it does, you may Attach this card to a Friendly model&apos;s card if it is BtB and Permitted.

Requirement [Loyal &amp; Samurai]</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
